        <p class="updated">Last updated: 17 April 2026</p>

        <p>Welcome to Dirty Laundry. By using the Dirty Laundry website or mobile app (the "Service"), you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the Service.</p>

        <h2>WHO CAN USE IT</h2>
        <p>You must be 13 or older to create your own account. Children under 13 may use the "kid" role only if a parent or guardian sets up their account and manages their participation. Parents are responsible for their kids' use of the Service.</p>

        <h2>YOUR ACCOUNT</h2>
        <p>You're responsible for keeping your login details safe and for anything that happens under your account. If you spot unauthorised access, email us immediately at hello@dirtylaundry.club.</p>

        <h2>GROUPS AND SHARED DATA</h2>
        <p>Dirty Laundry is built around groups (households, flatmates, families). Anything you post to a group — chore names, photos, reactions, comments — is visible to all members of that group. Don't post anything you wouldn't want your whole household to see.</p>

        <h2>ACCEPTABLE USE</h2>
        <p>Don't use the Service to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Post illegal, harassing, hateful, or sexually explicit content</li>
          <li>Upload photos of anyone who hasn't agreed to be photographed</li>
          <li>Impersonate someone else</li>
          <li>Attempt to break, scrape, or overload the Service</li>
          <li>Use it for anything other than household chore management</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We can suspend or terminate accounts that break these rules.</p>

        <h2>USER CONTENT</h2>
        <p>You keep ownership of anything you post (chore names, photos, etc.). By posting, you grant us a limited licence to store and display that content to the other members of your group, solely so the Service can function. We don't use your content for advertising, training models, or anything outside the app.</p>

        <h2>DELETING YOUR DATA</h2>
        <p>You can delete your account at any time from the Profile screen in the app. This permanently removes your profile, points, completions, and any photos you've uploaded. Data shared with your group (e.g. chores you created) may remain visible to that group, but will no longer be attributed to you.</p>

        <h2>THE SERVICE IS PROVIDED "AS IS"</h2>
        <p>We do our best to keep Dirty Laundry running smoothly, but we can't promise it will be available 24/7, bug-free, or suited to every household. We provide the Service "as is", without warranties of any kind. Your use of it is at your own risk.</p>

